WEBVTT

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
Both today and tomorrow, I've got time to kick back.

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:21.660
kyou mo ashita mo HIMAKKUSU

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
My family of four and I are going to stay the night.

00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:24.830
gokazoku yonin de goippaku

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
Put on an Egyptian front and become a sphinx,

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:27.670
EGIPUTO kidori de SUFINKUSU

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
and for an American feeling, Texas!

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.460
AMERICA kibun de TEXAS

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
When you're sitting pretty, with enough and to spare,

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:33.470
yoyuu SHAKUSHAKUPPE itsumo

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
and yet you always shilly-shally,

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:35.680
funya funya de iruto

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
and your bitter face and bitter feelings both teeter-totter,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:39.890
nigamushi hara no mushi nahe nahe to

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
it's time to get out of there!

00:00:39.970 --> 00:00:43.390
tettai shichau yo

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
I am feeling Ultra Relax,

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.730
watashi ha URUTORA RIRAKKUSU

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
a wonderful, invincible Relax.

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:49.940
SUTEKI ni muteki na RIRAKKUSU

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
A one-step-above kind of Deluxe.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.900
hito aji chigau ze DERAKKUSU

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
I may be a little jumbled,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:54.070
toccharakatte mo

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
but when I'm called on, ba-ba-ba-ba-bang!

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.860
yobarerya PAPAPAPAAAN!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
I always feel Relax,

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.910
watashi ha itsudemo RIRAKKUSU

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
a humble, simple, sort of Deluxe.

00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:01.870
WABISABI kikasete DERAKKUSU

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
Bright! Clear! Alert-headed, peep-peep!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.830
BIKKARI! KIKKARI! saeteru ATAMA PII! PII!

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
Keep your eyes on me, okay!?

00:01:05.120 --> 00:01:07.920
watashi no KOTO dake mitete ne!

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:35.860
My name is Kurata Sana, first year
middle school student.

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.700
Aoki - Award winning author, Mama,
the squirrel is Maro-chan.

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.620
Manager and driver, Rei-kun.
He's actually my ex-boyfriend.

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:43.540
Mysterious white bat Babbit.

00:01:43.540 --> 00:01:46.160
Use some insecticide,
kill all mosquitoes.

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:50.340
Hayama Akito, who does karate, a
passionate lone wolf, also my best friend.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:54.300
Matsui Fuka, best friend I met in
the bathroom with an Osaka accent.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:55.760
It's starting!

00:01:56.260 --> 00:01:59.260
The movie press conference is...
about to start.

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:02.930
Sana is like a different person.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.890
Sana-chan is so cool.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.700
Actress Goes to the
Mountains to Shoot a Movie

00:02:17.740 --> 00:02:19.740
Hiroto played by
Kamura Naozumi

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.160
My heart is on fire!

00:02:22.160 --> 00:02:26.330
I won't be upstaged by Sana-chan's talent! I'm going to work really hard!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.960
Mako played by Kurata Sana

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:35.090
I've been trying to empty my head
so that I can think about what a ghost feels.

00:02:35.090 --> 00:02:37.510
But it was empty to begin with so
I didn't have to bother.

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:39.550
Miwa played by Kurumi Asako

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:44.510
Hope we can do together, to help
the two of them reach their full potential.

00:02:44.350 --> 00:02:46.850
Masato played by
Kawai Takamitsu-sensei

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.980
A character possessed by spirits...

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:54.230
To create the most realistic
result I'm on a diet, like this...

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.400
Please ask any questions about
the movie.

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:58.150
Well... Sana-chan...

00:02:58.150 --> 00:03:01.490
This is your first time making
a movie with your boyfriend.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.240
Boy... boyfriend?

00:03:03.240 --> 00:03:06.740
Boy and friend means male friend, right?

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.790
So, how do you feel about that?

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.580
You're asking me how I feel?
I don't feel anything special!

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.090
Kamura-kun, I heard your
character is in love with Sana-chan's character.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:20.430
But you two are already dating in
real life, right?

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:21.930
What? Date?!

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:26.720
Date? How? We almost never see
each other at all outside of work.

00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:30.730
Almost? Does that mean you see
each other occasionally?

00:03:30.730 --> 00:03:32.020
Not really.

00:03:32.020 --> 00:03:35.020
Where do you two normally go?
Are you usually in disguise?

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.440
We're not really dating...

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:40.610
Please tell us the truth,
Naozumi-kun.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:42.570
You two are dating, right?

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.790
Why?! This is weird!
Why is everyone talking about this?

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:51.120
Can we just talk about the movie,
auntie?!

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:54.380
Sana is speaking incoherently again.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.880
Why does everyone immediately
assume that?

00:03:56.880 --> 00:03:58.420
You don't have to be so angry.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.590
Why are you getting so mad over what I said?

00:04:00.590 --> 00:04:03.300
You only want to know Hayama's motives.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.220
It is true.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:10.180
But why does the press always like
to make such a big deal about who's with?

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.560
True, true, no wonder
Sana-chan's angry...

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:16.810
There's nothing between her and
Kamura-kun except work.

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:18.570
Right, Akito-kun?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.940
How should I know?

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.450
As you requested,
let's talk about the movie.

00:04:25.450 --> 00:04:28.280
The leading role in the movie is
Naozumi-kun, right?

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.160
Well, I haven't read
the script yet but...

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:34.000
...I think there are two leading roles.

00:04:34.000 --> 00:04:39.130
But I heard from the producer
Naozumi-kun's role is more important.

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.800
- That's probably true...
- Sana-chan...

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:45.380
However, since this movie is shot
from Nazoumi-kun's point of view...

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:48.300
I can only win using my acting skills.

00:04:52.020 --> 00:04:54.440
Scared yet?

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.730
Sana-chan is acting like a ghost
and joking around.

00:04:57.730 --> 00:04:59.480
It's not scary? Strange.

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.400
Sana-chan, please stop!

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:05.860
I'm so sorry that she's making
a fool out of herself.

00:05:05.860 --> 00:05:09.830
She's good but I won't lose to her
on acting skills... I'm gonna do my best.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.370
Next, we want to ask the director
Ono Mikio a few questions.

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.620
Director, please.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:17.670
I'm the director.

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:20.880
Scary...

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:24.590
Director
Ono Mikio

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:24.470
That was scary,
he's like a ghost himself.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:25.720
Watch out...

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:28.890
I'm putting a lot of energy into
this work...

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:30.640
Almost all the scenes are
on location...

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:34.680
We're going on location in the mountains where there isn't any electricity.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.560
How long will that be?

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:39.440
About two months, maybe longer.

00:05:41.110 --> 00:05:42.730
Stuck in the mountains for
two months?

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.110
What is this?

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:47.410
Does that mean we can't see
Sana-chan for two months?

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.870
He said it could be longer.

00:05:49.870 --> 00:05:51.990
It could go on until the summer break.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.540
We can't see her for three months?

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.080
If that's the case,
she may have to be held back.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.880
Eh? Held back?

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:00.380
How can that happen?

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.300
This is a private school,
being held back is not unusual.

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.880
But sometimes,
the school should just let it go.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:08.840
But she can't come back for a while.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:19.440
The movie...
after it starts filming...

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:24.110
...we won't be able see much of
each other...

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:30.240
Not seeing each other...
will probably be lonely...

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.200
Will you be lonely?

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:38.460
As long as we're not dead,
we can meet each other.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:47.090
Akito-kun...

00:06:47.880 --> 00:06:50.430
Hi, it's the principal.

00:06:50.430 --> 00:06:51.930
The broadcast has ended.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.640
Principal, you scared me!

00:06:53.680 --> 00:06:55.930
Sana later

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:01.900
On the next day, Sana had interviews and photo shoots to promote the movie.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:07.110
Sana's schedule everyday is filled
with tons of work.

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:11.030
I don't want this...
I don't want this either.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.990
Sana-chan, how about this?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.120
Rei-kun, you have such bad taste!
What kind of clothing is that?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.330
Really?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:20.870
She's finally in junior high...

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:22.880
...but she can't even go...

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:27.210
...because she's so busy...
she's so cheerful and full of energy...

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:31.550
Maybe she has already realized...
the special life of an actress.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:36.720
She's no longer doing this because of a promise she made me...

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:42.520
How will she do in show biz?
I'm looking forward to finding out...{checar correspondência de linhas}

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:47.860
Sensei! Keep this up
and we can make our deadline!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:52.240
Yo, Onda. You don't have to worry,
it'll be done in a minute.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.160
What is this? Sensei! This...

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:59.370
How can a squirrel know how to
write?!

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.410
Bye, Maro-chan, I'll leave
everything else to you.

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:05.040
Ah! Sensei, it's not enough just
to fill the paper with letters!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.710
Please stop joking with me!

00:08:06.710 --> 00:08:08.590
It's useless, Onda-san.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.920
Umm... Is Fuka-chan here?

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.260
Hey, it's Tsuyoshi-kun.

00:08:14.720 --> 00:08:17.850
Fuka-chan, is Sana-chan still
absent today?

00:08:17.850 --> 00:08:20.060
Yeah, looks like she's really busy.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:22.140
Club activities are starting today.

00:08:22.140 --> 00:08:24.400
She's like a ghost member.

00:08:24.690 --> 00:08:26.110
Really?

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:30.360
It can't be that Sana-chan's
just going to leave like this?

00:08:30.990 --> 00:08:32.860
Rehearsal is starting now! Hurry, hurry!

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:34.280
I know, I know.

00:08:34.280 --> 00:08:36.070
Did you memorize all your lines?

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:38.450
That director is really scary.
His spirit will come out...

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:40.040
Like this.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.910
That look is so scary,
please spare me.

00:08:43.910 --> 00:08:46.500
Sana-chan, the departure time
has been decided.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.340
It's Wednesday.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.960
I already told the school.

00:08:50.960 --> 00:08:52.970
You have to get ready.

00:08:53.670 --> 00:08:55.090
Really...

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.180
...it seems so sudden.

00:08:57.850 --> 00:08:59.310
Akito-kun...

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.350
I think you should clear
everything up.

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:04.310
What are you talking about?

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:07.100
Akito-kun, you love Sana-chan,
don't you?

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:09.820
You should tell her before she leaves.

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.030
You won't be able to see her for
two months...

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.860
...and she will be with
Naozumi-kun all the time.

00:09:14.860 --> 00:09:16.820
I didn't know whether I should say
something...

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:21.240
After the affair between her and
her manager... she turred to love idiot.

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:27.670
She said she was very embarrassed
with her illusion of love.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:33.670
I'm so embarrassed!

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:36.220
That time...

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:40.010
That's why, I think if you don't
tell her, you'll regret it.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:43.930
Didn't I already tell you that
night, to clear everything up?!

00:09:49.190 --> 00:09:52.070
Things wouldn't be this way if you
told her that night.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:56.400
Akito, just talking big is
not enough.

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:57.860
You're good-for-nothing!

00:09:57.860 --> 00:09:59.200
You're so annoying!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:00.870
Mind your own business.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.450
Bye, I'm going to karate!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:04.080
Akito-kun, are you running away?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.040
But... I thought you didn't have
karate today.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:10.420
The test to go up one level is next
week so I have special practice.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:14.710
Is it testing time?
Why didn't you say so?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:17.090
You made me nervous.

00:10:17.090 --> 00:10:19.090
What are you doing here?

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.390
Akito-kun, wait for me!

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.600
Akito-kun, if you're going out,
then I better get going too.

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:28.600
Something like that... no way.

00:10:30.810 --> 00:10:36.240
Telling a girl things like that...
it's embarrassing.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:39.030
I don't think that's it.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:42.530
No, Akito-kun, you're just weird
when it comes to some things.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:45.700
Shut up, you annoying bastard!

00:10:45.700 --> 00:10:48.580
Don't think you're better than me
just because you have a girlfriend, idiot!

00:10:48.580 --> 00:10:52.840
I never said that. And if you keep acting this way, I won't worry about you.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:56.550
- Hayama is so weird...
- What are you laughing at? Idiot.

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.510
Confession... confession...

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:05.760
Ah! It's embarrassing!

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:11.230
- I'll go park the car in the garage.
- Ok!

00:11:13.940 --> 00:11:15.820
Is someone there?

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:22.200
Must be my imagination. I'm home!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.040
Ah! Why is there someone hanging
around right here?

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:31.710
Suspicious person,

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.380
show yourself!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:35.540
You are...

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:40.010
...the bushy eye-browed classmate!
What are you doing here?

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:45.510
What's *ghost backwards*?

00:11:45.510 --> 00:11:47.510
{parte b}

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:51.100
It's ghost!

00:11:51.600 --> 00:11:54.150
Yoho, Fuka! Fuka.

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:56.150
Sana! Long time no see...
you're still alive.

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:57.730
Yeah, it's been five days.

00:11:57.730 --> 00:11:59.820
You seem very busy.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.900
Yeah, I'm leaving next week.

00:12:01.900 --> 00:12:03.280
I heard it's Wednesday.

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.660
It's so sudden.

00:12:04.660 --> 00:12:07.740
I'll be lonely if you're not here.
But, do your best!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.370
Yeah, you too!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.710
By the way, what are you going to
do about club activities?

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:14.380
- I'll do it when I get back.
- Really.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.380
Hey, bushy eye-browed classmate,
you're still here? What a dangerous fellow.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.630
Sana-chan...

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.300
I can't believe I stuck my hands
in his nostrils.

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:28.680
- He likes to lend a hand.
- Pay back time.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:31.100
Sorry I kept you waiting, Fuka.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.310
Yours looks good,
what are you having?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.650
Special super sized combo.

00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:38.440
Eat as much as you can
while you're still here.

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:41.070
When you're in the mountains, you
won't find anything this good.

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:44.070
Fuka, it's not like I'm going to
an uncivilized tropical island.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.240
It's Hayama?!

00:12:46.740 --> 00:12:48.620
Hey, Hayama.

00:12:48.620 --> 00:12:50.160
What?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:53.120
Sana-chan, long time no see.
How are you?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.420
Aya-chan, Tsuyoshi-kun,
long time no see.

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.290
Sana, hurry, come over here!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:12:58.670
Ok!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:03.760
Sana is leaving next Wednesday.

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.680
Eh? Next Wednesday? Really?

00:13:06.680 --> 00:13:07.970
That's right.

00:13:07.970 --> 00:13:09.430
It's so sudden.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.770
You won't be coming back for
two months?

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:12.980
That's right.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.940
Aya-chan, you won't
forget about me, right?

00:13:15.940 --> 00:13:17.980
Of course I won't, Sana-chan.

00:13:17.980 --> 00:13:21.190
That's right,
how can we forget about you?

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.650
Right, Akito-kun?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.860
What? What are you staring at,
Akito-kun?

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.410
You won't be able to see
Sana-chan for a long time.

00:13:29.870 --> 00:13:32.080
Akito-kun, where are you going?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.410
Karate practice.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:36.540
Karate practice?
Akito-kun, wait a minute!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:39.710
What's the matter with that guy?
He's really strange...

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:41.960
Hayama?

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:52.470
Hayama, you'd feel better if you'd
just say what's on your mind.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.680
You're in the way, get lost!

00:13:54.680 --> 00:13:59.440
You didn't have to use violence,
why couldn't you just have talked to me?

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.400
Sana-chan is leaving this week...

00:14:06.400 --> 00:14:07.990
Hayama is so...

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:11.450
I'm full! I'm full!
I feel so blessed...

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:13.410
You ate a lot.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:16.080
It's been a long time since I had
lunch here.

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.000
That reminds me, I brought dessert.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.420
What's this?

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:26.010
Kurata Sana-sama, please meet me in the back yard after school.

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:27.720
What's this?

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:32.260
After school

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:32.180
I have an emergency, Babbit is
leaving early, bye.

00:14:39.060 --> 00:14:40.940
Sorry I kept you waiting.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.020
Ah! Sana-chan!

00:14:43.020 --> 00:14:44.860
Did you give me this?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:48.150
Yes, sorry to bother you.

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:51.490
The bushy eye-browed,
bloody nose...

00:14:51.490 --> 00:14:52.700
My name is Ishida.

00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:55.080
That's right, Ishida-kun,
what do you want?

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.080
Umm, I...

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.540
<i>Please don't bleed...</i>

00:15:00.540 --> 00:15:02.080
Umm... Umm...

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.750
I...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.880
I love you!

00:15:08.380 --> 00:15:10.970
I was just a fan before...

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:14.560
...but now...
I love you as a normal girl!

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:17.770
So please go out with me!

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.850
Please, Sana-chan, I'm serious!

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:26.900
What's that in his eyes? Is this a
so-called confession?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.690
What should I do?

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:31.740
He says he loves me... l'll feel
very guilty if I refuse without a reason...

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:35.160
...but I don't want to go out
with him either.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:37.410
It feels like I'm standing on top
of a cliff!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.910
What should I do at a time like this?
They don't teach it at school!

00:15:40.910 --> 00:15:45.590
Umm... Sana-chan, I wanna know if
you're going out with Kamura Naozumi.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:47.880
What are you talking about?
I'm very angry!

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:49.590
Where did this come from?!

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:53.390
But the articles written in the
magazines about it seem so real...

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:55.850
...and it was on the last
press conference.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.020
But that's why I'm saying...

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:03.230
Really, so that's how the public
looks at me and Naozumi-kun...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:05.060
Umm... Sana-chan...

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:08.650
If you're really going out with
Kamura Naozumi, please tell me...

00:16:08.650 --> 00:16:10.400
...and I'll give up.

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:14.240
Give up? Did you say give up?

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:17.830
If I say I'm going out with
Naozumi-kun, he'll give up...

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:20.120
I guess I don't have any another excuse...

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:22.330
...I'll just have to do it this way!

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.880
Bingo, you've got the correct answer!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.710
I knew it!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:30.300
That's right, there's something special going on between me and Naozumi-kun.

00:16:30.300 --> 00:16:32.720
But please
don't tell anyone else...

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.220
...that includes animals, animals
like parrots like to talk.

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:39.430
Especially this one,
If he knows, I'm doomed!

00:16:36.350 --> 00:16:39.430
I was about to go home,
what are you doing?

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.440
I understand. I'll give up.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:46.480
But I'll still be your fan.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:48.190
I wish for your happiness!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:50.780
Ishida-kun, wait!

00:16:50.780 --> 00:16:52.900
Please don't stop me, Sana-chan!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:56.280
Be careful, there's a tree
in front of you.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:16:59.200
So embarrassing, farewell!

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:02.620
Farewell, Ishida-kun.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:06.040
I got caught when I was about to
go home.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:08.460
Namu-namu...
amen... amen...

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:11.840
I'm having goose bumps,
Sana-chan, what are you doing?

00:17:11.840 --> 00:17:16.050
I just told the biggest lie in
my life.

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:18.010
But it's all right, right?

00:17:18.010 --> 00:17:21.600
- Don't they say anything may justify a lie?
- What are you talking about?

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.770
The correct answer is,
circumstances may justify a lie. Study hard.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:27.270
Who are you, old man?

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:30.690
This time we can't see each other
for two months...

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:34.110
When you come back, you'll be a
real actress...

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:37.030
You probably won't need me anymore...

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:40.700
Hey, Sana-chan, I'll only ask for
one favor in this lifetime, please help.

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.700
What is it?

00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.000
Can you give me Kurumi Asako-san's
phone number?

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:46.620
Ok, here you go.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:49.500
You had it already, didn't you?

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:51.920
Asako-chan... kiss, kiss.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:56.380
Actually, that's really
Andou-sensei's phone number!

00:17:59.890 --> 00:18:03.180
Confused Zenjiro-san, I can use
this as a guard against you!

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.640
What if Asako-san sees it?

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:08.940
- Sana-chan, give it back!
- No way...

00:18:08.940 --> 00:18:12.070
Sana-chan, wait, wait a minute...

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:19.740
The movie...
after it starts filming...

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:23.990
...we won't be able see much of
each other...

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:31.000
Not seeing each other...
will probably be lonely.

00:18:34.090 --> 00:18:35.840
Will you be lonely?

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:44.060
They're about to start making
the movie, right?

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:46.270
Yeah, the preparation is back-breaking...

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.560
Hayama!

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:56.490
What are you standing there for?
Are you having diarrhea?

00:18:56.490 --> 00:18:57.650
Shut up!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:18:59.320
Why do you have scratches
on your hand?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:03.990
Right, you're doing karate!
Tsuyoshi-kun said you're practicing really hard.

00:19:03.990 --> 00:19:07.660
Let me watch you next time,
it looks like fun.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.290
- No.
- Why?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.870
There's nothing to watch.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:14.420
Babbit is preparing too.
I'm busy, very busy.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.710
Ok, next.

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.390
Hello, Aya-chan?

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:26.810
Since we won't be able to see each
other for a long time, I'm calling everyone.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:28.430
I'm ok, thank you.

00:19:28.430 --> 00:19:31.270
Bye, Aya-chan,
I'll see you after two months.

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:36.230
Sana-chan, don't just make phone calls, we have to hurry up and finish packing.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:38.530
We're leaving very early tomorrow.

00:19:38.530 --> 00:19:41.110
- There's only one person left.
- Fine, then hurry up.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.450
One person left...

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.040
Hayama.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.870
We haven't talked much recently.

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:53.500
Brown belt. That's great...

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:56.290
- You worked really hard. I guess.
- Yes.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:20:00.510
Akito, Sana-chan called earlier.

00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:04.550
She said she'll be leaving early
tomorrow morning.

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:06.510
Akito, are you going to call her?

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:08.220
She'll be gone for a long time.

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:10.850
Akito, are you listening?
Strange kid!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:13.270
Bye, Mama, I'm leaving!

00:20:13.940 --> 00:20:16.730
Be careful, Sana, do your best!

00:20:16.730 --> 00:20:18.900
Sana-chan, take care of yourself.

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:19.990
Ok!

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:22.570
Sana-chan, come ride in here.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:24.910
I'll take the bus with
everyone else.

00:20:26.620 --> 00:20:28.790
Good morning!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.330
Good morning, Sana-chan.

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:33.830
Naozumi-kun, good morning,
good to see you.

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:35.670
Alright, let's go!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:44.890
Mama, Shimura-san, later,
bye-bye!

00:20:47.890 --> 00:20:49.010
That's...

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:50.970
Hayama...

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.480
Excuse me, please stop the bus for
a second!

00:20:59.940 --> 00:21:02.110
I knew it...

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:03.700
Hayama.

00:21:06.410 --> 00:21:09.160
Why, why... you came here to
see me off?

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.120
No... I'm doing morning exercise.

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.160
Brown Belt.

00:21:14.750 --> 00:21:16.880
You passed the test?

00:21:16.880 --> 00:21:19.380
Congratulations.
This is great, Hayama.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.630
I'll do my best on the movie too.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:25.050
Hey, Sana-chan, hurry up,
let's go!

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:26.720
Ok, I'll be there in a minute!

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:29.140
Kurata.

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:30.560
What is it?

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:33.350
I have something to tell you.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.350
What do you want to tell me?

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:38.360
I can't say it here.

00:21:39.690 --> 00:21:41.860
I'll tell you when you get back.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:45.530
Ok, I got it. You'll tell me when
I get back, right?

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.860
It's only three months anyway.

00:21:47.860 --> 00:21:49.950
I'll look forward to hearing it,
Hayama.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:52.290
Sana-chan, we'll leave you here
if you don't come soon.

00:21:52.290 --> 00:21:53.750
Ok, I'm coming!

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:59.500
Bye, Hayama, I better get going. Say hello to everyone for me!

00:22:16.600 --> 00:22:20.480
Although she said it's a separation of only two or three months...

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:22.440
